sis":"As the MRC continues its torturous work, Pailsen reveals the truth behind Chirico's seeming invincibility."},{"title":"Shooting","synopsis":"Barkoff's team is ordered to a base near the planet's north pole, but a malfunction with their transport plane leaves them unexpectedly stranded."},{"title":"Frozen Prison","synopsis":"A new crisis threatens to wipe out the planet's atmosphere, but the changing weather isn't the only threat looming on the horizon..."},{"title":"Down Burst","synopsis":"With time running out, the team must concoct a PRL formula that can withstand the oncoming extreme cold. Meanwhile, Wappe sets off on a mission of his own."},{"title":"Motion Tactics","synopsis":"Wokkam proposes a major attack on Monad, the Balarant fortress-planet, but there is more to this attack than meets the eye."},{"title":"Immortal Unit","synopsis":"As Gilgamesh operatives invade Monad, Chirico's origins are at last brought to light."},{"title":"Monad","synopsis":"Time is running out as Monad spirals toward destruction. Can Chirico make it out in time, or is his journey fated to end at last?"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
